                <td style="padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Machinery oils, paraffin waxes, asphaltenes, heavy bitumen, polymerized carbon greases</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
